[gd_scene format=3]

; The Heart, past the Effigy (map offset (602.5, -191)): the centre of the planet, what the machines call paradise. A vast
; hall; stepping in drops the gates (BossSeal) until Nirvanary (a boss placeholder) is still. Beyond the east gate the
; heart itself turns in its rings, and reaching it ends the game (the end card, then a new pilgrimage).

